33	   * Removes this entire line (all units) from the cart — a single call, never looped, regardless
34	   * of the line's current quantity (SFCC-270 AC8 / SFCC-272 AC3). The actual SFCC
35	   * `removeItemFromBasket` call is the caller's own responsibility (SFCC-11 plan step 4.6,
36	   * `cartDrawerContainer.tsx`, not built yet) — this component only ever calls this prop once per
37	   * click, and again (at most once) if a wishlist move succeeds.
38	   */
39	  onRemove: () => void | Promise<void>;
40	  /**
41	   * Attempts the real wishlist-add for an authenticated shopper. The actual SDK call is the
42	   * caller's own responsibility (step 4.6) — this component only calls it and reacts to the
43	   * result. Resolves to a discriminated union so this component can choose the right feedback
